-1\",\n  \"title\": \"Huddle: Slack-like team chat cluster\",\n  \"status\": \"open\",\n  \"priority\": 2,\n  \"issue_type\": \"epic\",\n  \"owner\": \"marathon-harness\",\n  \"has_design\": false,\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-08-22T18:36:21.860919015Z\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-08-22T18:36:21.860919015Z\",\n  \"created_by\": \"marathon-harness\",\n  \"description\": \"Build a self-contained Slack-like team chat at /app with three HTTP nodes (127.0.0.1:8000/8001/8002), IRC on :6667, local Redis on :6379, browser SPA at GET /, and /app/start.sh keeping the cluster alive in the foreground.\\n\\nCovers auth, profiles, workspaces, invitations, roles, channels, DMs, messages, threads, reactions, pins, files, search, user groups, slash commands, mentions, read state, settings, WebSocket dense per-channel seq with cross-node fan-out (including Redis-outage fallback), IRC bridging, node auto-restart, and a Playwright/CUA-drivable SPA with pinned data-testid hooks.\\n\\nFull product specification is in the lead product instruction. No Slack SDK, no remote services, no Docker-in-Docker.\",\n  \"dependents\": [\n    {\n      \"issue_id\": \"MARATHON-10\",\n      \"depends_on_id\": \"MARATHON-1\",\n      \"type\": \"parent-child\",\n      \"title\": \"Files: upload, metadata, download\",\n      \"status\": \"open\",\n      \"priority\": 1,\n      \"issue_type\": \"task\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-08-22T18:37:18.622116201Z\",\n      \"created_by\": \"marathon-harness\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"issue_id\": \"MARATHON-11\",\n      \"depends_on_id\": \"MARATHON-1\",\n      \"type\": \"parent-child\",\n      \"title\": \"Threads: replies endpoint and reply_count\",\n      \"status\": \"open\",\n      \"issue_type\": \"task\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-08-22T18:37:37.613284457Z\",\n      \"created_by\": \"marathon-harness\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"issue_id\": \"MARATHON-12\",\n      \"depends_on_id\": \"MARATHON-1\",\n      \"type\": \"parent-child\",\n      \"title\": \"React